      "headline": "Anthropic’s best AI model struggles to attract users as cheaper tools thrive",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "23rd August 2026 - Link Blog Anthropic’s best AI model struggles to attract users as cheaper tools thrive (via) A few interesting numbers in this FT story gathered from \"people with knowledge of the matter\": - Anthropic's \"annualized revenue\" for July is up to $65bn - it was $47b",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-24T15:40:48.511888+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "bb3683c7cfa9fd47a8b3c03b5ba5b190b865a76b5c89ac20793bc29cf46bb0de",
          "excerpt": "23rd August 2026 - Link Blog Anthropic’s best AI model struggles to attract users as cheaper tools thrive (via) A few interesting numbers in this FT story gathered from \"people with knowledge of the matter\": - Anthropic's \"annualized revenue\" for July is up to $65bn - it was $47b",
