            "now",
            "here",
            "August 20"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "\"It also told investors that it had 6,000 customers that spend $100,000 annually or more.\" - As for OpenAI, \"annualised revenue has jumped 35 per cent in the quarter to date and is now over $40bn, with the launch of GPT 5.6 in July jolting the company’s performance after a sluggi",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-24T15:40:48.511932+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "bb3683c7cfa9fd47a8b3c03b5ba5b190b865a76b5c89ac20793bc29cf46bb0de",
          "excerpt": "\"It also told investors that it had 6,000 customers that spend $100,000 annually or more.\" - As for OpenAI, \"annualised revenue has jumped 35 per cent in the quarter to date and is now over $40bn, with the launch of GPT 5.6 in July jolting the company’s performance after a sluggi",
